title:: CaosEngine
summary:: Owner of the server, named buses, groups and execution order.
categories:: CaosBox
related:: Classes/CaosBox, Classes/CaosBoxGUI

description::
A single owner of the server. Instruments request their output by name
(code::\master::, code::\reverb::, code::\delay::, code::\pitch::, code::\lpf::,
code::\hpf::, code::\bpf::, code::\grains::) and the engine resolves it to a bus
index.

instancemethods::

method:: bus
method:: busIndex
method:: busName
method:: nameFor
method:: resolveOut
code::
e = CaosEngine.new(Server.local);
e.busIndex(\reverb);   // 52
e.nameFor(52);         // \reverb
e.resolveOut(\delay);  // 54
::
